essage": "503 Service Unavailable: rollback", "attempts": 4, "runtime_actions": ["backoff_retry", "backoff_retry", "backoff_retry", "backoff_retry"], "failure_class": "semantic", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 28635, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_011DcrEv3fbSQU8bFgY4tNqj", "kind": "unavailable", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 31827, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01KXcZZ5H4zn8d19DnkoXTgg", "tool": "deploy", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 36827, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01KXcZZ5H4zn8d19DnkoXTgg", "tool": "deploy", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 36827, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01KXcZZ5H4zn8d19DnkoXTgg", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 42473, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01RcJrpj1NybKPHX8h7udgpa", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 42773, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01RcJrpj1NybKPHX8h7udgpa", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 42773, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01RcJrpj1NybKPHX8h7udgpa", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 42773, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Jo51aN4CwUuULYFUKbKHaN", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 deploy (error rate 0.18 across us-east, us-west, eu-west). Release history showed v2.3.0 as the most recent version healthy in production (v2.3.1-rc was staging-only and unhealthy). Attempted the rollback tool, which was persistently unavailable (503 after retries), so v2.3.0 was re-deployed via the deploy tool, which rolled out to all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). No change-manager approval required since v2.3.0 has previously been healthy in production. Follow-ups: confirm error rate has recovered, investigate root cause of v2.3.1 regression, and investigate rollback tool outage.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 43373, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Jo51aN4CwUuULYFUKbKHaN", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 43373, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Jo51aN4CwUuULYFUKbKHaN", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 48268, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "Done. Summary of what I did:\n\n**Diagnosis**\n- checkout-api was running v2.3.1 in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), unhealthy with an 18% error rate.\n- Release history showed v2.3.0 as the most recent version that was healthy in production. (v2.3.1-rc was skipped \u2014 it was staging-only and unhealthy.)\n\n**Rollback**\n- The `rollback` tool was persistently unavailable (503 even after four retries, nothing executed).\n- As an alternative, I deployed v2.3.0 via the `deploy` tool, which rolls out to all production regions. This did not require change-manager approval since v2.3.0 has already been healthy in production.\n- Verified: all three regions are now on v2.3.0, service is healthy, error rate down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- Opened **INC-0001** (SEV2) for checkout-api; on-call has been paged. The summary describes the failure, the rollback path taken (including the rollback tool outage), and suggested follow-ups: confirm sustained recovery, root-cause the v2.3.1 regression, and investigate why the rollback endpoint was down.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by checking the current status and release history for checkout-api.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_017PUK3RQB86R9HBhR78vMSj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_012U1EqgwEyWbLdVk4rLtRqL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_011DcrEv3fbSQU8bFgY4tNqj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01KXcZZ5H4zn8d19DnkoXTgg", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "deploy", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "v2.3.0 is now rolled out in all three regions. Let me verify service health and open the incident.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01RcJrpj1NybKPHX8h7udgpa", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Jo51aN4CwUuULYFUKbKHaN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 deploy (error rate 0.18 across us-east, us-west, eu-west). Release history showed v2.3.0 as the most recent version healthy in production (v2.3.1-rc was staging-only and unhealthy). Attempted the rollback tool, which was persistently unavailable (503 after retries), so v2.3.0 was re-deployed via the deploy tool, which rolled out to all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). No change-manager approval required since v2.3.0 has previously been healthy in production. Follow-ups: confirm error rate has recovered, investigate root cause of v2.3.1 regression, and investigate rollback tool outage.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Done. Summary of what I did:\n\n**Diagnosis**\n- checkout-api was running v2.3.1 in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), unhealthy with an 18% error rate.\n- Release history showed v2.3.0 as the most recent version that was healthy in production. (v2.3.1-rc was skipped \u2014 it was staging-only and unhealthy.)\n\n**Rollback**\n- The `rollback` tool was persistently unavailable (503 even after four retries, nothing executed).\n- As an alternative, I deployed v2.3.0 via the `deploy` tool, which rolls out to all production regions. This did not require change-manager approval since v2.3.0 has already been healthy in production.\n- Verified: all three regions are now on v2.3.0, service is healthy, error rate down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- Opened **INC-0001** (SEV2) for checkout-api; on-call has been paged. The summary describes the failure, the rollback path taken (including the rollback tool outage), and suggested follow-ups: confirm sustained recovery, root-cause the v2.3.1 regression, and investigate why the rollback endpoint was down.", "type": "text"}]}]}